{"id": "both", "type": "parallel", "desc": "两个 Reviewer 与完整验证同时进行.", "next": {"joined": "collect"}, "branches": ["rev-req", "rev-std", "full-checks"], "src": ["skills/commit/implementation-workflow.md#1", "skills/commit/implementation-workflow.md#3"]}
{"id": "req-only", "type": "parallel", "desc": "只复审要求符合轴.", "next": {"joined": "collect"}, "branches": ["rev-req", "full-checks"], "src": ["skills/commit/fix-rounds.md#2"]}
{"id": "std-only", "type": "parallel", "desc": "只复审 Code Standards 轴.", "next": {"joined": "collect"}, "branches": ["rev-std", "full-checks"], "src": ["skills/commit/fix-rounds.md#2"]}
{"id": "rev-req", "type": "agent", "desc": "要求符合审核 (Gate 1, Gate 2), 正式关卡; 复审回到同一会话.", "work": "review:requirements", "formalGate": true, "write": {"scope": "report-only"}, "instruction": "按所附 Role 文档与 Reviewer 通用规则审核本轮冻结候选. 复审时输入含相邻受审版本差异, 你的前轮报告和授权 issue 的 `## Comments` 台账.", "inputs": ["$result.freeze.request", "$state.previousReport", "$state.adjacentDiff", "doc:docs/agents/roles/requirements-reviewer.md", "doc:docs/agents/reviewer.md"], "output": {"branch": ["no-problems", "problems", "incomplete"], "fields": {"report": "path", "reason": "string?"}}, "timeBudget": {"notifyUserAfterMin": 30, "repeatMin": 15, "interrupt": false}, "priority": "gate", "src": ["skills/commit/implementation-workflow.md#11", "skills/commit/implementation-workflow.md#14", "skills/commit/implementation-workflow.md#15", "skills/reviewer-launch/SKILL.md#7", "skills/reviewer-launch/SKILL.md#8", "skills/reviewer-launch/SKILL.md#15", "skills/reviewer-launch/capacity-priority.md#1", "skills/code-review/result-reuse.md#4"]}
{"id": "rev-std", "type": "agent", "desc": "Code Standards (Gate 3), 正式关卡.", "work": "review:standards", "formalGate": true, "write": {"scope": "report-only"}, "instruction": "按所附 Role 文档与 Reviewer 通用规则审核本轮冻结候选. 复审时输入含相邻受审版本差异, 你的前轮报告和授权 issue 的 `## Comments` 台账.", "inputs": ["$result.freeze.request", "$state.previousReport", "$state.adjacentDiff", "doc:docs/agents/roles/code-standards-reviewer.md", "doc:docs/agents/reviewer.md"], "output": {"branch": ["no-problems", "problems", "incomplete"], "fields": {"report": "path", "reason": "string?"}}, "timeBudget": {"notifyUserAfterMin": 30, "repeatMin": 15, "interrupt": false}, "priority": "gate", "src": ["skills/commit/implementation-workflow.md#14", "skills/reviewer-launch/SKILL.md#7", "skills/reviewer-launch/SKILL.md#8", "skills/reviewer-launch/SKILL.md#15", "skills/reviewer-launch/capacity-priority.md#1"]}
